title: "HARP-I: Harmonic Phase Interpolation"
abstract: >-
  Harmonic phase interpolation for estimating tissue motion and strain from
  2D and 3D tagged magnetic resonance images, as a MATLAB toolbox and as a
  Python package with a graphical interface.
